sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Usuario as Usuário
    participant Front as Browser static/js
    participant API as FastAPI app/main.py
    participant Session as Session Manager / workspace JSON
    participant Pipeline as pipeline_service.py
    participant LLM as LLM Service<br/>Gemini/DeepSeek
    participant Sandbox as SandboxExecutor<br/>bubblewrap ou python-guard
    participant FS as workspace<br/>uploads, filtered, scripts, reports

    Usuario->>Front: Upload de arquivos + prompt + provider/modelo
    Front->>API: POST /api/sessions
    API->>FS: Salva uploads em workspace/uploads
    API->>Session: Cria sessão com current_goal, files, settings
    API-->>Front: job_id
    API->>Pipeline: background run_pipeline(job_id)

    loop Polling de status
        Front->>API: GET /api/sessions/{job_id}
        API->>Session: Lê estado da sessão
        API-->>Front: status, logs, artifacts, template, pdf_version
    end

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over Pipeline: Pipeline inicial / regeneração completa

    Pipeline->>FS: Lê uploads
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: extract_metadata local<br/>CSV/Excel/PDF metadata

    alt PDF precisa de insights
        alt PDF tem text_excerpt
            Pipeline->>LLM: generate_document_insights()<br/>operation=document_extraction
        else PDF sem texto extraído
            Pipeline->>LLM: call_llm_with_pdf()<br/>Gemini com PDF anexado<br/>operation=document_extraction_pdf
        end
        LLM-->>Pipeline: document_insights
        Pipeline->>Session: Salva document_insights
    end

    alt Prompt sugere filtro/preprocessamento
        Pipeline->>LLM: generate_data_filter()<br/>operation=data_preprocessing
        LLM-->>Pipeline: código preprocess_dataframes/filter_dataframes
        Pipeline->>Sandbox: execute_script(preprocess_*.py)
        Note over Sandbox: Código gerado executa isolado.<br/>Lê uploads/filtered/scripts/reports.<br/>Escreve filtered/scripts/reports/tmp.<br/>Rede, subprocess e ctypes bloqueados.
        Sandbox->>FS: Gera CSV preprocessado em workspace/filtered
        Sandbox-->>Pipeline: stdout/stderr/manifest
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: Reextrai metadata dos CSVs preprocessados
    end

    Pipeline->>LLM: generate_artifacts()<br/>operation=artifact_plan
    LLM-->>Pipeline: plano de artifacts<br/>metric, graphic, text
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: validate_report_plan()
    Pipeline->>Session: Salva artifacts + validações

    alt Título ainda vazio
        Pipeline->>LLM: generate_report_title()<br/>operation=title_generation
        LLM-->>Pipeline: título
        Pipeline->>Session: Salva settings.title
    end

    loop Para cada artifact type=metric tabular
        Pipeline->>LLM: calculate_metric_value()<br/>operation=metric_value<br/>gera Python
        LLM-->>Pipeline: código de cálculo
        Pipeline->>Sandbox: execute_script(código da métrica)
        Sandbox-->>Pipeline: JSON/value via stdout
        Pipeline->>Session: Salva calculated_metrics
    end

    Pipeline->>Pipeline: generate_template()<br/>layout local por template/fallback
    Pipeline->>Session: Salva template

    loop Para cada gráfico sem código e não library-only
        Pipeline->>LLM: generate_component_code()<br/>operation=component_code
        LLM-->>Pipeline: função Python render_<id>()
        Pipeline->>Session: Salva components[id]
    end

    alt Existem text artifacts a atualizar
        Pipeline->>LLM: generate_all_texts()<br/>operation=text_generation
        LLM-->>Pipeline: textos por component id

        alt Texto estimado não cabe no bloco
            Pipeline->>LLM: condense_texts_to_fit()<br/>operation=text_condensation
            LLM-->>Pipeline: textos condensados
        end

        Pipeline->>Pipeline: Converte textos em render_text_block()
        Pipeline->>Session: Salva components de texto
    end

    Pipeline->>Pipeline: assemble_script()
    Pipeline->>FS: Escreve workspace/scripts/{job_id}.py
    Pipeline->>Session: Salva script, script_path, pdf_path

    Pipeline->>Sandbox: execute_script(script final)
    Sandbox->>FS: Lê dados e escreve workspace/reports/{job_id}.pdf
    Sandbox->>FS: Escreve manifest de componentes
    Sandbox-->>Pipeline: success ou stderr

    alt Render OK
        Pipeline->>Session: current_step=completed, pdf_version++
    else Render falhou e fallback possível
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: Troca render_mode<br/>library -> hybrid -> generated_code
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: Reentra em pipeline/script conforme necessário
    else Render falhou sem fallback e ainda há retry
        Pipeline->>LLM: fix_script()<br/>operation=script_fix
        LLM-->>Pipeline: script corrigido
        Pipeline->>Sandbox: execute_script(script corrigido)
    else Excedeu retries
        Pipeline->>Session: current_step=failed
    end
    end

    Usuario->>Front: Abre PDF
    Front->>API: GET /api/sessions/{job_id}/pdf
    API->>FS: Lê workspace/reports/{job_id}.pdf
    API-->>Front: application/pdf

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
    Note over Usuario,Pipeline: Entradas posteriores do usuário

    Usuario->>Front: Adicionar arquivo
    Front->>API: POST /api/sessions/{job_id}/files
    API->>FS: Salva novo upload
    API->>Pipeline: background run_pipeline(job_id)

    Usuario->>Front: Editar artifacts/código manual
    Front->>API: PUT /api/sessions/{job_id}/artifacts
    API->>API: validate_component_code() se código manual veio
    API->>Session: Atualiza artifacts/components
    API->>Pipeline: run_pipeline(), exceto defer_pipeline=true

    Usuario->>Front: Editar layout visual
    Front->>API: PUT /api/sessions/{job_id}/template
    API->>Session: Salva template
    API->>Pipeline: run_script_generation()
    Pipeline->>Sandbox: execute_script(script final atualizado)

    Usuario->>Front: Alterar settings/provider/modelo
    Front->>API: PUT /api/sessions/{job_id}/settings
    alt Mudou idioma
        API->>LLM: translate_workspace()<br/>operation=workspace_translation
        LLM-->>API: artifacts/components traduzidos
    end
    alt Mudou template ou estilo visual
        API->>Pipeline: run_pipeline()
    else Só settings de render
        API->>Pipeline: run_script_generation()
    end

    Usuario->>Front: Regenerar textos/gráficos/componente/tudo
    Front->>API: POST /api/sessions/{job_id}/regenerate
    API->>Session: Limpa caches correspondentes
    API->>Pipeline: run_pipeline()
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 235)
    Note over Usuario,LLM: Refinamento por chat

    Usuario->>Front: Feedback no chat
    Front->>API: POST /api/sessions/{job_id}/chat
    API->>Session: Atualiza refinement_history/current_goal
    API->>Pipeline: process_chat_refinement()

    Pipeline->>LLM: refine_session_modular()<br/>operation=refinement_routing
    LLM-->>Pipeline: target = component_id | LAYOUT | SETTINGS | ALL

    alt Target é componente
        Pipeline->>LLM: operation=refinement_component<br/>gera nova render_<id>()
        LLM-->>Pipeline: código refinado
        Pipeline->>Session: Atualiza component
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: run_script_generation()
        Pipeline->>Sandbox: Renderiza PDF
    else Target é LAYOUT
        Pipeline->>LLM: operation=refinement_layout<br/>gera JSON de layout
        LLM-->>Pipeline: template JSON
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: run_script_generation()
    else Target é SETTINGS
        Pipeline->>LLM: operation=refinement_settings<br/>gera settings JSON
        alt Idioma mudou
            Pipeline->>LLM: translate_workspace()
        end
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: run_script_generation()
    else Target ALL
        Pipeline->>Session: Marca needs_full_regeneration
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: run_pipeline()
    end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
    Note over Usuario,Sandbox: Exploração e preview

    Usuario->>Front: Pergunta exploratória sobre os dados
    Front->>API: POST /api/sessions/{job_id}/explore
    API->>LLM: generate_exploration_script()<br/>operation=exploration_script
    LLM-->>API: Python de exploração
    API->>Sandbox: execute_script(explore_*.py)
    Sandbox-->>API: stdout ou stderr
    API->>Session: Salva explore_history
    API-->>Front: answer

    Usuario->>Front: Preview de componente
    Front->>API: GET /api/sessions/{job_id}/components/{component_id}/preview
    API->>API: Monta script de preview<br/>do script existente ou assemble_script()
    API->>Sandbox: execute_script(preview)
    Sandbox->>FS: Escreve PDF de preview em workspace/reports
    API-->>Front: application/pdf
    end
